    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "医生说：“你不要喝咖啡，不要吃太辣的菜，也不要吃巧克力和冰淇淋……”",
      "traditional": "醫生說：“你不要喝咖啡，不要吃太辣的菜，也不要吃巧克力和冰淇淋……”",
      "pinyin": "yī shēng shuō nǐ bú yào hē kā fēi bú yào chī tài là de cài yě bú yào chī qiǎo kè lì hé bīng qí lín",
      "english": "Little Ming had a stomachache and went to see the doctor."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The doctor said: “Don’t drink coffee, don’t eat too spicy food, don’t eat chocolate or ice cream…”"
    },
    {
